  "_comment": [
    "How scripts/sitewatch.py turns DNS lookups into sites. Each key is a domain suffix; the longest",
    "matching suffix wins. A string value names the site; null means background noise (CDNs, OS",
    "services, telemetry) that isn't something a person chose to use, so it's dropped. A lookup",
    "that matches nothing is shown under its registrable domain (e.g. tahoedailytribune.com).",
    "Lookups Pi-hole blocked (ads and trackers on the StevenBlack list) are always dropped."
